/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 62 0 R
/E (Overall, the website demonstrates a moderate level of security risk. While it functions as intended, certain improvements are recommended to enhance protection, strengthen user data security, and align with standard web security practices.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
